{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418840/extras/b70de4ff9ad30d5523fc9dcbfd45b4f2.avif?t=1691265600\" width=616 height=181 /></span><br><br><strong>Schoolmare</strong> is a survival horror game where you fall in love with a teacher. But it was a trap\u2026 You need to get out of the school and not be killed by a horrible monster.<br><br><strong>This spooky atmosphere will keep you awake:</strong> you need to find keys and other items to get out of the school. But it won't be easy, you will be chased by a scary, fat, mustachioed monster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418840/extras/69887e99fe2cf69c3416a977e84b10d3.avif?t=1691265600\" width=616 height=179 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COME UP WITH YOUR ESCAPE TACTICS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Explore</strong></li></ul>Explore the location and look for places where you can hide.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Collect</strong></li></ul>Collect extra items to replenish your health, stamina etc.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Survive</strong></li></ul>Survive and don't get caught by the monsters, run as fast as you can.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418840/extras/52c8f383d8e0c464af3a0625c8f43cbd.poster.avif?t=1691265600\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418840/extras/52c8f383d8e0c464af3a0625c8f43cbd.webm?t=1691265600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418840/extras/52c8f383d8e0c464af3a0625c8f43cbd.mp4?t=1691265600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_